    fix: stop bleeding money — 5 critical fixes
    
    1. Stop over-trading: analysis 60s→300s, loss cooldown 3→10min, add 5min post-trade cooldown
    2. Let winners run: profit_close 0.8→1.5%, trail_trigger 0.2→0.5%, trail_lock 70→50%
    3. Widen SL/TP: Gold SL 30→50 pips, TP 50→80 pips, ATR multiplier 1.5→2.5x
    4. Disable Silver: 21.9% win rate, -$1609 P&L — focus on Gold (58% win rate)
    5. Fix SELL bias: counter-trend veto ±8→±15 (was blocking ALL buys on bearish days)
    
    Data-driven: analyzed 625 trades, 463 churn re-entries=-$1756, 135 SL exits=-$2138

